; Coast Road: 16 bars in D major at 150 BPM, loops (about 26 s).
; A lead, B syncopated bass, D drums. Channel C is left out: Paula channel 2
; is the engine. Sound effects borrow channel D, so the drums drop out then.
#title Coast Road
#tempo 150
#inst lead square vol=36 decay=1
#inst bass pulse25 vol=40 decay=1
#inst kick kick vol=56
#inst snare snare vol=38
#inst hat hat vol=20

; ---- lead: D Bm G A | D Bm Em A || G A F#m Bm | G A D D
A @lead l8
A o5 a f+16 a16 > d < a b a f+4    | o5 f+ d16 f+16 b a f+4 d4
A o5 g b16 > d16 g f+ e d < b4     | o5 a4. g+ a b > c+4
A o5 f+ a16 > d16 f+ e d < a b4    | o5 b a16 f+16 d f+ a4 b4
A o5 g f+16 e16 g b > e4 d c+      | o5 a2 r4 c+ e
A o5 b4 > d < b a g a4             | o5 c+4 e c+ < a > c+ e4
A o5 f+ a > c+ < a f+ a > c+ e     | o6 d4 c+ < b a4 f+4
A o5 g b > d g f+ d < b > d        | o6 e4 c+ < a > e f+ e c+
A o6 d4. c+ d f+ a4                | o6 a2 r < a b > c+

; ---- bass: root, octave, root, two sixteenths, octave, root, root, octave
B @bass l8
B o2 d > d < d d16 d16 > d < d d > d | o2 b > b < b b16 b16 > b < b b > b
B o2 g > g < g g16 g16 > g < g g > g | o2 a > a < a a16 a16 > a < a a > a
B o2 d > d < d d16 d16 > d < d d > d | o2 b > b < b b16 b16 > b < b b > b
B o2 e > e < e e16 e16 > e < e e > e | o2 a > a < a a16 a16 > a < a a > a
B o2 g > g < g g16 g16 > g < g g > g | o2 a > a < a a16 a16 > a < a a > a
B o2 f+ > f+ < f+ f+16 f+16 > f+ < f+ f+ > f+ | o2 b > b < b b16 b16 > b < b b > b
B o2 g > g < g g16 g16 > g < g g > g | o2 a > a < a a16 a16 > a < a a > a
B o2 d > d < d d16 d16 > d < d d > d | o2 a > a < a a16 a16 > a < a a > a

; ---- drums: kick on 1 and the "and" of 3, snare on 2 and 4, hats between
D o4 l8 [@kick c @hat c @snare c @hat c @kick c @kick c @snare c @hat c]16
